WEBVTT

40:14.750 --> 40:18.459
But your younger son
will be working a modest CI job,

40:19.084 --> 40:20.709
with a salary that does him no good,

40:21.417 --> 40:25.917
and a hopeless ambition to grow
as big as his elder brother.

40:26.209 --> 40:30.709
In an attempt to save the only
piece of land he owns now,
